# ─── Environment (compose root) ───────────────────────────────
# F-2 (2026-09-28): `/.env` alone left every OTHER root-level `.env.*` name
# uncovered — in particular `.env.production`, which is the exact filename a
# production deployment is most likely to create at the root by analogy with
# `backend/.env.production` (that one IS covered, by backend/.gitignore).
# No file at this path has ever existed or been tracked (verified against the
# full history and the current working tree) — this closes the gap before one
# does, rather than in response to an actual exposure.
/.env
.env.local
*.local
.env.*
!.env.example

# ─── Dependencies ─────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
vendor/

# ─── Build artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────────
/frontend/dist/
/frontend/.vite/
/backend/public/build/
/backend/public/hot

# ─── Python (docs build pipeline) ─────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# ─── Scratch (design/QA screenshots, throwaway scripts) ───────
/frontend/tmp-ally/

# ─── OS / IDE ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
*.swp

# ─── Logs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log

# ─── Database backups ─────────────────────────────────────────
/backups/

# ─── Claude Code (local, machine-specific — never commit) ─────
# Shared config lives in .claude/settings.json; this file is a local
# per-machine permission cache.
.claude/settings.local.json

# ─── Obsidian vault (local docs workspace + plugin binaries) ──
# No authored notes are tracked here; canonical docs live in /docs/.
/vault/

# ─── Graphify (generated knowledge graph) ─────────────────────
# Machine-regenerable via `graphify update .`; keep .graphifyignore tracked.
/graphify-out/

# Note: backend/ and frontend/ get their own .gitignore from
# the Laravel and Vite scaffolds; this file covers the repo root
# and anything created before those scaffolds exist.

# Production secret files (Docker Compose secrets) — never committed
/secrets/*.txt
